flowchart LR
  subgraph Channels[Sales channels]
    WEB[Own website\nWebhook + DB/API]
    NY[Nykaa\nWebhook + 1 SKU REST]
    FK[Flipkart\n2-min poll + bulk REST]
    BL[Blinkit\nWebhook + CSV/urgent REST]
  end

  ALB[ALB / API Gateway]
  API[NestJS API\nvalidate, normalize, idempotency]
  POLL[Flipkart poller]
  CMD[Order command handler]
  DB[(PostgreSQL RDS\norders + inventory + ledger\noutbox + projections)]
  REDIS[(Redis / BullMQ\nqueues + rate limits)]
  STOCK[Stock push workers\nper-channel adapters]
  ERPW[ERP delivery worker]
  ERP[Microsoft Business Central]
  OPS[Ops screen\nfailed syncs + retry]
  OBS[CloudWatch metrics/logs/alerts]

  WEB --> ALB
  NY --> ALB
  BL --> ALB
  ALB --> API --> CMD
  POLL --> CMD
  CMD -->|atomic reservation + outbox| DB
  DB -->|publish durable jobs| REDIS
  REDIS --> STOCK
  REDIS --> ERPW
  STOCK --> WEB
  STOCK --> NY
  STOCK --> FK
  STOCK --> BL
  ERPW --> ERP
  OPS --> DB
  API --> OBS
  CMD --> OBS
  STOCK --> OBS
  ERPW --> OBS
